"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.20<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 2, 2008<br/>Summer Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20080515195335&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goldfish_Bowl_Immobile_2245e4.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a goldfish bowl.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>In <a href=\"#/wiki/Eclesius\">Eclesius</a>' house (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32289,32291,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32289, 32291, 6)</a>), and in <a href=\"#/wiki/Theodore%20Loveless\">Theodore Loveless</a>' private room (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32359,32791,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32359, 32791, 6)</a>).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Fish are easily maintained pets.<br/>Looks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Goldfish%20Bowl\">Goldfish Bowl</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fishnapped%20Goldfish\">Fishnapped Goldfish</a>.<br/><br/>Interacted with in <a href=\"#/quest/the-scatterbrained-sorcerer-quest\">The Scatterbrained Sorcerer Quest</a> and <a href=\"#/quest/the-thieves-guild-quest\">The Thieves Guild Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fishnapped%20Goldfish\">Fishnapped Goldfish</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goldfish%20Bowl\">Goldfish Bowl</a></li><li>Other Objects</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-scatterbrained-sorcerer-quest","the-thieves-guild-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-scatterbrained-sorcerer-quest","quest":"The Scatterbrained Sorcerer Quest","step":"2-0","n":6,"title":"Pedir a tarefa","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32291,"y":32291,"z":7,"label":"Eclesius"}]},{"slug":"the-scatterbrained-sorcerer-quest","quest":"The Scatterbrained Sorcerer Quest","step":"2-3","n":9,"title":"Alimentar o peixe","kind":"mention","coords":[]},{"slug":"the-thieves-guild-quest","quest":"The Thieves Guild Quest","step":"6-6","n":32,"title":"Raptar o peixe","kind":"mention","coords":[]}],"spots":[{"x":32289,"y":32291,"z":6,"text":"In Eclesius ' house ( here ), and in Theodore Loveless ' private room ( here )."},{"x":32359,"y":32791,"z":6,"text":"In Eclesius ' house ( here ), and in Theodore Loveless ' private room ( here )."}]}}